Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.12,0:00:27.92,Usaghi Main I,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,What was {\i1}that just now?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.22,0:00:41.52,TS1,Sign,0000,0000,0000,,{\fscx101.25\fscy70\pos(377,251)}Kawachi
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.59,0:00:40.18,Usaghi Main,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah, okay...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.93,0:00:42.14,Usaghi Main,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,I was just getting up.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.43,0:00:46.65,Usaghi Main,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, I see. Got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.52,0:00:50.48,Usaghi Main,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Don't worry about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.02,0:00:54.74,Usaghi Main,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,We'll meet up to bargain with them early next week, all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.53,0:00:57.41,Usaghi Main,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Talk to you later.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.62,0:01:06.62,Usaghi Main I,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,My maternal grandfather died last night.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.38,0:01:10.17,Usaghi Main I,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,That dream I had...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.17,0:01:12.80,Usaghi Main I,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Was that Grandpa
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.80,0:01:14.21,Usaghi Main I,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,and Mom?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.51,0:01:24.98,Usaghi Main I,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,It seems like he lost touch with all of our relatives.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.21,0:01:51.04,Usaghi Main I,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,I come back after all this time, and it's for a funeral.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.25,0:04:27.17,Usaghi Main,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,I'm here.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.88,0:04:30.38,Usaghi Main,Sachiko,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, Daikichi, you got here fast.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.38,0:04:32.63,Usaghi Main,Sachiko,0000,0000,0000,,Just put your bags in Grandpa's room.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.63,0:04:33.38,Usaghi Main,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.01,0:04:36.68,Usaghi Main,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,By the way, there was a girl in the yard.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.68,0:04:38.93,Usaghi Main,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,I can't remember, but is Haruko's girl around that age? {QC: Added the 'but' and 'around'}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.81,0:04:42.78,Usaghi Main,Sachiko,0000,0000,0000,,That wasn't Reina-chan.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.60,0:04:44.94,Usaghi Main,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Whose kid is she then? {QC: Added 'then'}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.56,0:04:50.32,Usaghi Main,Sachiko,0000,0000,0000,,Darn it! This kitchen is so inconvenient!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.32,0:04:59.45,Usaghi Main,Sachiko,0000,0000,0000,,I don't know what to do from here on out.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.03,0:05:02.77,Usaghi Main,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Well, he was 79 and died a peaceful death, didn't he?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.20,0:05:06.47,Usaghi Main,Sachiko,0000,0000,0000,,Apparently, that girl is Grandpa's illegitimate child.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.17,0:05:10.21,Usaghi Main,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}Grandpa's{\i0} child?!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.84,0:05:14.01,Usaghi Main,Sachiko,0000,0000,0000,,Grandpa didn't say a thing about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.05,0:05:17.38,Usaghi Main,Sachiko,0000,0000,0000,,His lover left him also.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.38,0:05:20.72,Usaghi Main,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,His lover? He was {\i1}79{\i0}!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.72,0:05:23.85,Usaghi Main,Sachiko,0000,0000,0000,,It's so embarrassing, not to mention shameful.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.18,0:05:26.02,Usaghi Main,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Then she's
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.02,0:05:27.94,Usaghi Main,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,your little sister
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.94,0:05:30.15,Usaghi Main,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,and my {\i1}aunt{\i0}.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.73,0:05:33.19,Usaghi Main,Sachiko,0000,0000,0000,,How can you make light of this?!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.73,0:05:37.20,Usaghi Main,Sachiko,0000,0000,0000,,You're 30 years old, don't make such thoughtless remarks!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.30,0:06:05.85,Usaghi Main,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,You died at peace, huh, Grandpa?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.24,0:06:28.91,Usaghi Main,Kenichi's Wife,0000,0000,0000,,How much should I give?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.41,0:06:31.71,TL Note,Note,0000,0000,0000,,Note: It's traditional to give money as condolences.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.91,0:06:32.50,Usaghi Main,Funeral Director,0000,0000,0000,,It's just a sign to express your good will, so any amount is fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.50,0:06:36.09,Usaghi Main,Kenichi's Wife,0000,0000,0000,,I know, but there's a certain standard amount, isn't there?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.09,0:06:38.30,Usaghi Main,Funeral Director,0000,0000,0000,,Honestly, any amount is fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.30,0:06:41.79,Usaghi Main,Funeral Director,0000,0000,0000,,Although these days, it's common for sutras to be recited
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.09,0:06:44.45,TL Note,Note,0000,0000,0000,,Note: For such services,the priest is to be paid.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.79,0:06:44.45,Usaghi Main,Funeral Director,0000,0000,0000,,and a posthumous Buddhist name to be given.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.27,0:06:50.23,Usaghi Main,Kenichi's Wife,0000,0000,0000,,She said it's around 400,000 to 500,000 yen. {Original: She said 400,000 to 500,000 yen.}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.64,0:06:52.94,Usaghi Main,Kenichi,0000,0000,0000,,That's a {\i1}big{\i0} sum of money.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.73,0:06:55.98,Usaghi Main,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Hello. It's been a long time.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.98,0:06:58.38,Usaghi Main,Kenichi,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, Daikichi. Long time no see.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.03,0:07:00.28,Usaghi Main,Kenichi,0000,0000,0000,,Have you been busy?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.90,0:07:02.49,Usaghi Main,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Yes, busy enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.49,0:07:06.95,Usaghi Main,Kazumi,0000,0000,0000,,He always say he's busy! Even though mother wants to meet him so much.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.20,0:07:09.75,Usaghi Main,Kazumi,0000,0000,0000,,He didn't even come home for New Year's.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.42,0:07:15.46,Usaghi Main,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,Wait! Reina!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.21,0:07:20.47,Usaghi Main,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,Stop it! Reina!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.22,0:07:22.22,Usaghi Main,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Haruko!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.80,0:07:25.26,Usaghi Main,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, Dai-chan! Long time no see!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.64,0:07:25.26,Usaghi Main Top,Reina,0000,0000,0000,,Mama!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.51,0:07:26.76,Usaghi Main,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,Reina!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.14,0:07:29.10,Usaghi Main,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,Gotcha!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.68,0:07:32.52,Usaghi Main,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,Now be a good girl, and don't run around!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.52,0:07:34.31,Usaghi Main Top,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,No way! I don't wanna!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.35,0:07:34.31,Usaghi Main,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.31,0:07:35.40,Usaghi Main,Kenichi,0000,0000,0000,,Nothing...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.03,0:07:43.07,Usaghi Main,Kenichi,0000,0000,0000,,You look a lot like your grandfather when he was younger.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.08,0:07:52.46,Usaghi Main,Yukio,0000,0000,0000,,Daikichi, did you hear?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.46,0:07:54.12,Usaghi Main,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah, from my mom earlier.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.12,0:07:56.58,Usaghi Main,Makio,0000,0000,0000,,I wonder if it's true.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.58,0:08:00.67,Usaghi Main,Makio,0000,0000,0000,,I'm sure my older brother was lonely living alone, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.92,0:08:03.22,Usaghi Main,Hideyuki,0000,0000,0000,,Apparently, there's a maternity health record book.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.22,0:08:05.05,Usaghi Main,Hideyuki,0000,0000,0000,,It says her name is "Rin."
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.05,0:08:08.72,Usaghi Main,Kenichi,0000,0000,0000,,Nevertheless, we're talking about a 79-year-old man.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.31,0:08:11.75,Usaghi Main,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Well, setting aside the question
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.75,0:08:13.69,Usaghi Main,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,of what your father might've done,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.69,0:08:15.44,Usaghi Main,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,I think you've gotta give him props.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.77,0:08:19.65,Usaghi Main,Sachiko,0000,0000,0000,,Daikichi, can you bring the cushions out of the closet for me? {Original: Daikichi, would you bring the cushions out of the closet for me?}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.65,0:08:20.42,Usaghi Main,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.60,0:08:51.22,Usaghi Main,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.20,0:09:13.45,Usaghi Main,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Hey, hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.08,0:09:15.91,Usaghi Main,Reina,0000,0000,0000,,Let's swap!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.33,0:09:18.17,Usaghi Main,Reina,0000,0000,0000,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.08,0:09:21.13,Usaghi Main,Reina,0000,0000,0000,,Leave it like it is!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.71,0:09:26.17,Usaghi Main,Reina,0000,0000,0000,,I did it!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.64,0:09:32.35,Usaghi Main,Reina,0000,0000,0000,,Hey, look, look!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.35,0:09:34.39,Usaghi Main,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,Reina, don't run!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.64,0:09:37.02,Usaghi Main,Sayuri,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, how clever!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.02,0:09:38.35,Usaghi Main,Reina,0000,0000,0000,,Is it pretty?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.35,0:09:42.23,Usaghi Main,Yukio's Wife,0000,0000,0000,,It certainly is! You're very good at Cat's Cradle, Reina-chan!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.61,0:09:47.36,Usaghi Main,Yukio's Wife,0000,0000,0000,,Try to make a four-square ladder next! {Original: Next, try to make a four-square ladder!}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.03,0:09:52.99,Usaghi Main,Yukio's Wife,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, my, Reina-chan. Here, let me show you.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.95,0:09:55.70,Usaghi Main,Reina,0000,0000,0000,,Poop bomb!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.70,0:09:57.21,Usaghi Main,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,Hey, Reina!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.55,0:10:47.67,Usaghi Main,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Oji-san. Oji-san!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.63,0:10:50.47,Usaghi Main,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Please, sleep ahead of me.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.47,0:10:52.47,Usaghi Main,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,I'll take my turn watching the incense.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.47,0:10:54.64,Usaghi Main,Kenichi,0000,0000,0000,,O-Okay then.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.10,0:10:58.98,Usaghi Main,Kenichi,0000,0000,0000,,Hey, don't sleep there! {Original: Hey, don't sleep in here!}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.81,0:11:02.98,Usaghi Main,Kenichi,0000,0000,0000,,Let's get some rest over there.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.35,0:11:05.15,Usaghi Main,Makio,0000,0000,0000,,What about the incense?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.15,0:11:07.32,Usaghi Main,Kenichi,0000,0000,0000,,Daikichi says he'll watch over it.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.78,0:11:09.86,Usaghi Main,Kenichi,0000,0000,0000,,Come on now.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.86,0:11:13.28,Usaghi Main,Makio,0000,0000,0000,,Take care of my big brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.46,0:11:22.67,Usaghi Main,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,You get some sleep over there too.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.75,0:11:26.17,Usaghi Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,I'm fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.96,0:11:29.84,Usaghi Main,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Look at that mug.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.99,0:11:48.55,TS2,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an5\frx16\fry318\frz21.129\pos(351,375)\fscx63.75\fscy125}Kaga Souichi
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.95,0:11:56.03,Usaghi Main,Funeral Director,0000,0000,0000,,All right, everyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.03,0:11:58.58,Usaghi Main,Funeral Director,0000,0000,0000,,Please make your final farewells.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.79,0:12:06.25,Usaghi Main,Relatives,0000,0000,0000,,Rest in peace.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.25,0:12:07.13,Usaghi Main,Relatives,0000,0000,0000,,Nii-san...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.13,0:12:07.88,Usaghi Main,Relatives,0000,0000,0000,,Ojii-chan...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.88,0:12:10.09,Usaghi Main,Relatives,0000,0000,0000,,Farewell.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.05,0:12:15.01,Usaghi Main,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,Come along, Reina.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.30,0:12:16.59,Usaghi Main,Reina,0000,0000,0000,,Okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.76,0:12:21.14,Usaghi Main,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,It's time to say goodbye to Grandpa.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.14,0:12:22.52,Usaghi Main,Reina,0000,0000,0000,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.19,0:12:30.98,Usaghi Main,Reina,0000,0000,0000,,Field of flowers!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.23,0:12:32.40,Usaghi Main,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,Stop it!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.49,0:12:38.16,Usaghi Main,Reina,0000,0000,0000,,No! I'm making a field of flowers!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.16,0:12:40.83,Usaghi Main,Reina,0000,0000,0000,,I wanna make it!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.63,0:12:51.05,Usaghi Main,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Come over here, and say goodbye too.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.65,0:13:13.90,Usaghi Main,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Place this on Grandpa. 
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.75,0:13:25.62,Usaghi Main,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.26,0:13:43.29,Usaghi Main I,Daikcihi,0000,0000,0000,,A bellflower.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.93,0:13:47.06,Usaghi Main I,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Grandpa loved that flower.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.16,0:14:10.63,Usaghi Main,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,That flower makes Grandpa the happiest.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.42,0:14:16.55,Usaghi Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,He's not going to wake up again?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.51,0:14:26.18,Usaghi Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,No. He's not going to wake up.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.80,0:14:41.86,Usaghi Main I,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,You... really are Grandpa's child, aren't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.99,0:15:11.42,TS3,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fscx82.5\fscy128.75\pos(431,277)}Heisei \N23
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.99,0:15:11.42,TS3,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fscx50\fscy73.75\pos(352,390)\b1}Buddhist's Memorial Tablet
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.99,0:15:11.42,TS3,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fscx75\fscy132.5\pos(281,282)}2nd \NSep\Ntem\Nber
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.71,0:16:04.64,TS4,,0000,0000,0000,,{\frx36\fry2\i1\frz336.522\fscx60\fscy51.25\pos(383,123)}Maternity Record Book
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.19,0:16:04.03,Usaghi Main,Yukio,0000,0000,0000,,Where did this "Yoshii Masako" go?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.70,0:16:07.78,Usaghi Main,Kenichi,0000,0000,0000,,I don't think it would do any good
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.78,0:16:11.04,Usaghi Main,Kenichi,0000,0000,0000,,to find the person who abandoned her child and ran away.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.04,0:16:13.66,Usaghi Main,Kenichi's Wife,0000,0000,0000,,How utterly irresponsible!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.12,0:16:17.58,Usaghi Main,Yoshiharu,0000,0000,0000,,My big brother was also stubborn about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.44,0:16:36.90,Usaghi Main,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,That's dangerous!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.90,0:16:39.98,Usaghi Main,Reina,0000,0000,0000,,That girl can't talk!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.98,0:16:41.32,Usaghi Main,Reina,0000,0000,0000,,It's a pain!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.32,0:16:43.36,Usaghi Main,Reina,0000,0000,0000,,And she still has all her baby teeth!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.36,0:16:45.11,Usaghi Main,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,She can talk!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.11,0:16:46.66,Usaghi Main,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,And she's not a pain!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.66,0:16:48.41,Usaghi Main,Reina,0000,0000,0000,,She can't talk!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.41,0:16:52.54,Usaghi Main,Reina,0000,0000,0000,,That's why it's so boring being with her!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.87,0:16:57.33,Usaghi Main,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Here! You can have all these if you go away.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.71,0:17:00.50,Usaghi Main,Daikcihi,0000,0000,0000,,You're like a candy shop owner!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.09,0:17:02.92,Usaghi Main,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,Sorry, Dai-chan.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.22,0:17:06.04,Usaghi Main,Kenichi,0000,0000,0000,,Setting aside the future,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.55,0:17:09.09,Usaghi Main,Kenichi,0000,0000,0000,,who's going to take care of that child {\i1}right now{\i0}?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.51,0:17:11.01,Usaghi Main,Yukio,0000,0000,0000,,Well, I can't.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.01,0:17:12.60,Usaghi Main,Yukio,0000,0000,0000,,Not when running the store.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.60,0:17:16.31,Usaghi Main,Kenichi,0000,0000,0000,,If only she were a little more proper... {QC: Added 'only'}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.31,0:17:19.11,Usaghi Main,Yukio's Wife,0000,0000,0000,,She seems to be suffering from delayed speech, too. {QC: Removed the 'And' at the very beginning, and added the comma before 'too'}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.11,0:17:20.13,Usaghi Main,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Mom....
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.42,0:17:24.76,Usaghi Main,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,You're at home a lot. Why don't you take her in for a while? {QC: Added 'a lot' after 'home'}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.43,0:17:28.05,Usaghi Main,Sachiko,0000,0000,0000,,Y-You know that'd be impossible!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.05,0:17:30.52,Usaghi Main,Sachiko,0000,0000,0000,,I don't have that much free time on my hands!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.06,0:17:34.98,Usaghi Main,Sachiko,0000,0000,0000,,Besides, do you even know how hard it is to raise a child?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.98,0:17:39.11,Usaghi Main,Sachiko,0000,0000,0000,,Haven't I made enough sacrifices over the years?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.44,0:17:41.40,Usaghi Main,Kazumi,0000,0000,0000,,I'd feel sorry for her if she came over,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.40,0:17:42.73,Usaghi Main,Kazumi,0000,0000,0000,,and no one had time for her.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.53,0:17:47.95,Usaghi Main,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Wasn't this meeting supposed to be about who would take in Rin?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.20,0:17:53.16,Usaghi Main,Kazumi,0000,0000,0000,,It's not like you have any intention of doing anything, do you, Onii-chan?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.16,0:17:55.33,Usaghi Main,Kazumi,0000,0000,0000,,Think about the situation more realistically.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.33,0:18:01.25,Usaghi Main,Kenichi's Wife,0000,0000,0000,,Even so, I'm not even certain that she {\i1}is{\i0} Grandpa's child.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.96,0:18:05.80,Usaghi Main,Kazumi,0000,0000,0000,,See? You haven't thought it through, so you can't even give me a comeback.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.63,0:18:44.84,Usaghi Main,Kenichi,0000,0000,0000,,For now, I say we try placing her in a facility as quickly as possible.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.18,0:18:53.22,Usaghi Main,Kazumi,0000,0000,0000,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.94,0:19:05.78,Usaghi Main,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Rin!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.29,0:19:21.92,Usaghi Main,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Want to come home with me?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.84,0:19:24.30,Usaghi Main,Sachiko,0000,0000,0000,,Hey! Daikichi!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.30,0:19:25.25,Usaghi Main,Kazumi,0000,0000,0000,,Onii-chan?!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.30,0:20:15.26,Usaghi Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Old man, I'm hungry.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.93,0:20:17.72,Usaghi Main,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,O-Old man?!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.64,0:20:20.52,Usaghi Main,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Don't call me "old man"!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.90,0:20:26.44,Usaghi Main,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,You're my {\i1}aunt{\i0}, after all! 
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.12,0:22:04.16,Usaghi Main,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Is it good?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.58,0:22:05.33,Usaghi Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Uh-huh.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.75,0:22:11.00,Usaghi Main,Daikcihi,0000,0000,0000,,More?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.00,0:22:11.84,Usaghi Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Uh-huh.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.17,0:22:14.17,Usaghi Main,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,All we have left is rice.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.55,0:22:16.13,Usaghi Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,I'll make a rice ball.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.88,0:22:19.05,Usaghi Main,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,I don't have anything you can put in a rice ball.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.93,0:22:20.89,Usaghi Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Salt!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.18,0:22:22.31,Usaghi Main,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Salt?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.94,0:22:28.48,Usaghi Main,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Hey! That's still hot!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.48,0:22:29.48,Usaghi Main,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Look!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.94,0:22:34.32,Usaghi Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,But it'll taste nice this way.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:34.82,0:22:36.70,Usaghi Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Here, Ojii-chan.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:37.53,0:22:40.07,Usaghi Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,I mean, Daikichi!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.74,0:22:42.49,Usaghi Main,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,"Daikichi" is strange too, you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.75,0:22:49.83,Usaghi Main,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,It's good.
